                     <tr><td>£1,500,001</td><td>£2,500,000</td><td>0</td><td>2.50</td></tr>
                     <tr><td>£2,000,001</td><td>£5,000,000</td><td>0</td><td>2.00</td></tr>
                     <tr><td>£5,000,001</td><td>£10,000,000</td><td>0</td><td>1.50</td></tr>
                  </tbody>
               </table>
            </div>
            
            <div class="pricing-note-block">
               <i class="fas fa-circle-info"></i>
               <div>
                  <strong>Private Market</strong>
                  <p data-block-key="n4e40">For companies looking to join our Private market, the fee is dependant on the number of trading events the company prefers. Fee will generally be anything <b>from £10,000 Excluding VAT.</b> <i>The agreed fee depends on complexity, asset class, company size, shareholder / nominee numbers etc.</i> Please get in touch with our team to discuss further.</p>
               </div>
            </div>
            
         </div>

         <div class="pricing-content" id="mbf-content">
            
            <div class="pricing-note-block">
               <i class="fas fa-circle-info"></i>
               <div>
                  <strong>Matched Bargain Facility (MBF)</strong>
                  <p data-block-key="tcyz3">For companies looking to join our Matched Bargain Facility, the annual fee typically starts from <b>£1250 per calendar month (15,000+ -Excluding VAT).</b> <i>The agreed fee depends on complexity, asset class, company size, shareholder / nominee numbers etc.</i> Please get in touch with our team to discuss further.</p>
               </div>
